# MSG_AI_USAGE_EXHAUSTED=Today's AI use is used up: get extra credit, or use your own AI via MCP.
# MSG_LIMIT_AUTO_APPLY=You've used today's {limit} Free auto-applies; they reset at {reset_time}.
# MSG_LIMIT_RESUMES=You've reached the Free limit of {limit} resumes: delete some, or subscribe.
# MSG_PAID_AI_SEARCH=AI job search comes with a Paid account.
# MSG_SUBSCRIBE_CONTACT=Please contact the admin to subscribe.
# MSG_CREDIT_CONTACT=Please contact the admin to purchase extra credit.
# MSG_CONTACT_EMAIL_MISSING=The admin has not set a contact email yet.
# MSG_PREPARE_CONFIRM=This may use a lot of your AI. Continue?
